								<command class_type='comment' title='' comment='Functionality for switching the solenoid on and off is generated by a 
component notification.

In the properties menu for the beam breaker and microswitch, the option 
for notification is enabled. This calls the Ev_user macro and passes the 
&quot;message&quot; value as an argument.

The Ev_user macro then enables or disables the solenoid depending on 
which switch was pressed.
